                                                "sense_id": "dab67821-06d4-3fc6-a861-112d56273e67",
                                                "text": "His fingers were nervously twitching."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a709a84e-8693-3376-bb7f-6a125403055e",
                                        "entry_id": "f148e024-fd5a-3e0f-add7-57f98145b691",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cause to twitch; spasm."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "789abbc6-816b-4e23-a03b-5684f605a3fe",
                                                "sense_id": "a709a84e-8693-3376-bb7f-6a125403055e",
                                                "text": "Their feet padded softly on the ground, and they crept quite close to him, twitching their noses..."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bd577aa4-8892-3605-97e9-3a285b8b7e05",
                                        "entry_id": "f148e024-fd5a-3e0f-add7-57f98145b691",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To jerk sharply and briefly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7034a1d-8f43-449c-9cdd-6b9975123e7d",
                                                "sense_id": "bd577aa4-8892-3605-97e9-3a285b8b7e05",
                                                "text": "to twitch somebody's sleeve for attention"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b0cffe8b-2366-4c93-aa94-3caf9b69d800",
                                                "sense_id": "bd577aa4-8892-3605-97e9-3a285b8b7e05",
                                                "text": "Thrice they twitched the diamond in her ear."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6a5a0e32-bd1d-3854-8fc5-240073ddba72",
                                        "entry_id": "f148e024-fd5a-3e0f-add7-57f98145b691",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To exert oneself."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "74f1aa7d-dfe6-34c7-95c4-77f1d1c79645",
                                        "entry_id": "f148e024-fd5a-3e0f-add7-57f98145b691",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To spot or seek out a bird, especially a rare one."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d644cd21-8fd8-4b05-80a4-e81578b9abe3",
                                                "sense_id": "74f1aa7d-dfe6-34c7-95c4-77f1d1c79645",
                                                "text": "\"The Birdwatchers Handbook ... will be a clear asset to those who 'twitch' in Europe.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "728b9fa7-2e80-4604-bd34-9f43e3372b3b",
                                                "sense_id": "74f1aa7d-dfe6-34c7-95c4-77f1d1c79645",
                                                "text": "\"But the key revelation from twitching that wonderful Iceland Gull on 10 March 1974 wasn't its eroticism. It was the sheer innocence of it.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d6f716b2-fc1f-4297-8196-fffa02915783",
                                                "sense_id": "74f1aa7d-dfe6-34c7-95c4-77f1d1c79645",
                                                "text": "\"I hadn't seen John since I went to Adelaide to (unsuccessfully) twitch the '87 Northern Shoveler, when I was a skinny, eighteen-year-old kid. \""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
